      "comment": "Four fulltext_search calls produced only two persisted log entries, log_006 and log_010, so the audit trail is genuinely incomplete. The stated mechanism is wrong though: the tool rejected three distinct refs saying they do not exist or are invalid JSON, not that they expired, and STAGING_TTL_MS is 24 hours against a run of 412 seconds, so nothing could have aged out."
